OL,3,GNEWSARepeatedly untruthful, callous and
OL,4,Aquiet - what we learned about Lucy
OL,5,ALetby from inquiry report
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew details have emerged about Lucy
OL,8,FLetby, the killer neonatal nurse -
OL,9,Fwhose name can evoke both staunch
OL,10,Fsupport and unequivocal disgust.
OL,12,FLetby, now 36, is serving 15 whole-life
OL,13,Fprison terms after being convicted of
OL,14,Fmurdering seven babies and attempting
OL,15,Fto murder seven others, including one
OL,16,Fbaby whom she tried to murder twice.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
