OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARepeatedly untruthful, callous and
OL,4,Aquiet - what we learned about Lucy
OL,5,ALetby from inquiry report
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a lengthy report, published by Lady
OL,8,FJustice Thirlwall earlier, she
OL,9,Fdescribed how Letby was "repeatedly
OL,10,Funtruthful in her dealings with friends
OL,11,Fand colleagues" and "her inappropriate
OL,12,Fand callous nature was noted by
OL,13,Fpatients and colleagues".
OL,15,FThe Thirlwall Inquiry was set up to
OL,16,Flook into what happened at the Countess
OL,17,Fof Chester Hospital between 2015 and
OL,18,F2016, while Letby was working as a
OL,19,Fnurse in the neonatal unit.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
